OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FTuesday brings bright spells and
OL,7,Fshowers, these spreading eastwards,
OL,8,Fsome heavy. More widespread rain
OL,9,Freturns on Wednesday, though the
OL,10,Fsoutheast staying dry. Thursday then
OL,11,Fsees sunshine, showers and brisk winds.
